%% request: CI/CD from GitHub to Cloud Run with staging approval
%% fixed from tool errors
flowchart LR
    classDef ci fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    classDef stg fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825
    classDef prod fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    classDef bad fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828

    Dev([Developer]) -->|git push / PR| GH[(GitHub Repo)]
    GH -->|webhook| CI["GitHub Actions CI<br/>lint, tests, build image, scan, push to Artifact Registry"]:::ci
    CI --> AUTH[Auth via Workload Identity Federation]
    AUTH --> DS["Staging: deploy to Cloud Run"]:::stg
    DS --> SMOKE[Smoke / e2e tests]:::stg
    SMOKE --> OK{Passed?}
    OK -- No --> ROLL[Rollback + notify Slack]:::bad
    OK -- Yes --> APPR{{Manual approval<br/>GitHub Environment reviewers}}
    APPR -- Approved --> PROD["Production: no-traffic revision, canary 10%, then 100%"]:::prod
    APPR -- Rejected --> STOP((Stop)):::bad
    PROD -. error rate high .-> ROLL
    PROD ==> DONE([Release complete]):::prod
